kground features a tropical beach scene with lush green palm trees swaying gently in the distance, their fronds casting dappled shadows on the sand, turquoise ocean waves rolling onto the shore, and a clear azure sky with soft white cumulus clouds. Lighting is bright, warm midday sunlight coming from the upper left, creating distinct soft shadows under the bunny and casting a warm glow on the orange shirt. Camera angle is a low eye-level shot looking slightly up at the bunny to emphasize its cuteness, using a shallow depth of field (f/2.8) to blur the background palm trees and ocean while keeping the bunny in sharp focus. Composition follows the rule of thirds, placing the bunny on the left vertical third line. Color palette"
